  <iati-identifier>XM-DAC-45001-C203</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-45001" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Trade Centre (ITC)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Public Goods: Providing trade and market intelligence for informed trade decisions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The projects (C203 and C271) will contribute to increased sustainable trade through improved business, trade, and market intelligence for greater Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises (MSMEs) competitiveness and better support to MSMEs to understand the role and implications of social and environmental sustainability standards in corporate sustainability due diligence. It will achieve this by updating and promoting the use of some existing ITC tools: Export Potential Map, Market Access Map, Trade Map and Standards Map, as well as by delivering a pilot approach on direct work with MSMEs at the intersection of CSDD requirements and existing voluntary sustainability initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
